{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260615110002","title":"Tenant Reality: Ilusi Kepemilikan Token Capital","desc":"Kritik bahwa perusahaan yang menggunakan AI via API sebenarnya tidak memiliki capital, melainkan hanya menyewa.","updated":1752566400000,"created":1752566400000,"tags":["zettel","ai-economy","platform-dependency"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260615110002","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"8d0d40c23ba680692610a47c1ec55333","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260615110002","id":"zettel.20260615110002","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260615110002","id":"zettel.20260615110002","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai-economy","alias":"ai-economy","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai-economy"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260615110002","id":"zettel.20260615110002","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.platform-dependency","alias":"platform-dependency","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.platform-dependency"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260615110002","id":"zettel.20260615110002","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.ai-economy.public-reaction-satya-vision","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":9,"offset":472},"end":{"line":6,"column":58,"offset":521},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.ai-economy.public-reaction-satya-vision"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.ai-enterprise-economy","id":"zettel.moc.ai-enterprise-economy","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":3,"offset":164},"end":{"line":8,"column":28,"offset":189},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.20260615110002"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"tenant-reality-ilusi-kepemilikan-token-capital\">Tenant Reality: Ilusi Kepemilikan Token Capital<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tenant-reality-ilusi-kepemilikan-token-capital\"></a></h1>\n<p>Konsep <em>Token Capital</em> menjadi semu ketika perusahaan mengakses AI melalui API atau langganan pihak ketiga. Dalam kondisi ini, perusahaan bukan berperan sebagai pemilik modal (<em>capital owner</em>), melainkan sebagai penyewa (<em>tenant</em>).</p>\n<p>Kontrol atas model, data training, dan infrastruktur tetap berada di tangan penyedia platform, sehingga \"capital\" yang dibangun perusahaan sebenarnya berada di atas tanah sewaan yang bisa berubah aturan atau harganya kapan saja.</p>\n<p>Relasi: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.ai-economy.public-reaction-satya-vision\">Dialektika Visi AI Satya Nadella: Antara Pemberdayaan dan Hegemoni</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai-economy (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">platform-dependency (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.ai-enterprise-economy\">MOC: AI Enterprise Economy</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":fals